							},
							"content:textarea:4:50": {
								"icon": "align-justify",
								"name": "Paragraph",
								"type": "textarea",
								"html": "<p>\n\tBeyond our collective efforts, The Salvation Army Sapulpa Women's Auxiliary is a place where believers come together to form a close-knit community. It is a nurturing environment where lasting friendships are forged, and shared faith and a passion for service bring us closer. By joining our auxiliary, you not only contribute to meaningful causes but also gain personal growth, new perspectives, and the joy of making a positive impact. Explore our website to learn more about our ongoing projects, upcoming events, and how you can get involved. Together, let's create a brighter and more compassionate Creek County.\n</p>",
								"description": "Mixed Plain and Rich Text",
								"draggable": true,
								"content": "Beyond our collective efforts, The Salvation Army Sapulpa Women's Auxiliary is a place where believers come together to form a close-knit community. It is a nurturing environment where lasting friendships are forged, and shared faith and a passion for service bring us closer. By joining our auxiliary, you not only contribute to meaningful causes but also gain personal growth, new perspectives, and the joy of making a positive impact. Explore our website to learn more about our ongoing projects, upcoming events, and how you can get involved. Together, let's create a brighter and more compassionate Creek County.",
